	(text "PWR_FLAG: this rail has no power_out pin anywhere on it, so ERC\ncannot see what drives it. The flag says a source is off-sheet.\nA rail a regulator drives does NOT get one."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 535.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bca33bdc-41dd-5ac4-8a06-ca54b0cf9fb9")
	)
	(text "UNO Q head hat rev B. Board-to-board pinout and the camera block copied from Arduino's UNO Media Carrier ASX00083 so arduino-linux-config\ncamera0=type1-2lanes applies. 2S pack -> 5 mOhm shunt -> AON6407. PTC F2 -> TPS61088 11.9 V -> JMEDIA 57/59 VIN (UNO Q's own buck). PTC F1 -> TPS62933\n5 V -> amplifier only; JMISC 54/56 open. Interrupts on 3.3 V MCU pins J2.3/7/9. D40 keeps the servo pull-ups off +3V3. One 3.3 V I2C bus (CCI0)\ncarries camera 0x10, expander 0x26, ToF 0x29, INA226 0x40, head IMU 0x6B and, on J12, the trunk IMU 0x6A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 543.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5966719c-e46c-5721-b8f7-15c146d4a367")
	)
